<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/17/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593], which is referred to as the “Code” in this Act, is amended in subsection 2(1) by inserting after the definition of “bailable offence” the following definitions: ‘ “communication” means a communication received or transmitted by post or a telegraphic, telephonic or other communication received or transmitted by electricity, magnetism or other means; “communications service provider” means a person who provides services for the transmission or reception of communications;’. Amendment of section 106A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/17/eng@> .
